{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"像熟人安静坐着 偶尔对视也不尴尬\",\"source\":\"也像相识已久的人安静坐着，不必拼命找话题；对方偶尔望来一眼，沉默也不让人紧张。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把对方单方面偶尔望来一眼改成双方偶尔对视，增加了互相对视这一动作。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸；美好时光恍惚间像已经成了回忆\",\"source\":\"白天明明和某个人相处得很好，晚上回到家后，心头却泛起一阵酸楚。独处把幽微的感受放大了：即使是最亲密的人，也没法陪你走进心里的每一个角落。甚至当美好的时光仍在眼前流淌时，恍惚间却像已经成了回忆。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把明确的晚上回到家后的场景泛化成独处时，丢掉了原来的具体时间和场景。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把原本用比喻表达的肩膀松开、胸腔打开，改成了这个人实际发生的身体变化。</escape>\"}]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2e4b542-62bf-4096-90ad-c437686f01e1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T102342426594Z", "elapsed_seconds": 326.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T10:29:08.960969+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f846ecc888cc478efd3aec5a4d33684e9c1ddc9cea5b1ed07da60b841c6d6248", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3